Windows setup builder:
- The Windows setup executable uses Inno Setup 6.7.3. Its release license
  credits Jordan Russell and Martijn Laan and permits commercial applications.
  The exact release license is at
  https://github.com/jrsoftware/issrc/blob/is-6_7_3/license.txt. The Inno Setup
